---
<div class="wrap page">
  <h1>How to Apply &amp; Requirements</h1>
  <p class="lede">Everything about applying, on one page. The application and screening are free — read the criteria below before you apply.</p>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="steps-h">
    <h2 id="steps-h">The three steps</h2>
    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step-card">
        <p class="step-num">1</p>
        <h3>Apply</h3>
        <p>Fill out the application and screening. Both are free.</p>
        <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://bfpapply.lovable.app/apply">Start an application</a></p>
        <p>The application runs on our screening site. Rent is paid through Apartments.com — this website never takes rent.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <p class="step-num">2</p>
        <h3>See it in person</h3>
        <p>Showings are in person only, and they happen after your application and screening pass. Then comes the credit/background check: $32 per adult, charged after screening passes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <p class="step-num">3</p>
        <h3>Sign &amp; move in</h3>
        <p>Sign the lease and pay half the deposit at signing. The other half is due at move-in.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="need-h">
    <h2 id="need-h">What you'll need</h2>
    <ul class="plain-list">
      <li>Photo ID for every adult (18+)</li>
      <li>Proof of income</li>
      <li>Rental history</li>
      <li>Voucher paperwork, if you hold a Housing Choice Voucher</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="criteria-h">
    <h2 id="criteria-h">Screening criteria</h2>
    <ul class="plain-list">
      <li>Positive landlord references — no past-due rent owed, no damages, no significant lease violations</li>
      <li>No evictions within the last 5 years</li>
      <li>No bad criminal history</li>
      <li>No utility collections</li>
      <li>Mostly positive payment history for the last 1–2 years</li>
      <li>No smoking inside the home — any substance, including marijuana</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="tracks-h">
    <h2 id="tracks-h">Two tracks: standard and voucher</h2>
    <div class="tracks-grid">
      <div class="track-card">
        <h3>Standard</h3>
        <ul class="plain-list">
          <li>Income at least 3× the monthly rent</li>
          <li>Deposit is set per home and stated on the home's page</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="track-card">
        <h3>Housing Choice Voucher</h3>
        <ul class="plain-list">
          <li>Income at least 1.5× the monthly rent</li>
          <li>Flat $1,000 deposit — half at signing, half at move-in</li>
          <li>At move-in, you owe only your portion of the first month's rent</li>
          <li>The housing-authority inspection and voucher paperwork are the program's own steps, handled with the housing authority</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="fees-h">
    <h2 id="fees-h">Fees, stated plainly</h2>
    <ul class="plain-list">
      <li>Application: free</li>
      <li>Screening: free</li>
      <li>Credit/background check: $32 per adult, charged after screening passes. It is not an application fee.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="movein-h">
    <h2 id="movein-h">Move-in</h2>
    <ul class="plain-list">
      <li>Proof of renter's insurance</li>
      <li>Utilities in your name</li>
      <li>An occupancy permit, where your city requires one</li>
      <li>Credit below 550 (standard track): first month's rent and last month's rent are due at move-in</li>
      <li>Voucher holders: only your portion of the first month's rent at move-in</li>
      <li>Sewer and trash billed by Bahr Family Properties are due at move-in</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The deposit is paid in two halves — half at signing, half at move-in. If Bahr Family Properties or the housing authority cancels before move-in, the halves are refundable. If you cancel, they are non-refundable.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="s8-h">
    <h2 id="s8-h">Section 8 welcome</h2>
    <p>Housing Choice Vouchers (Section 8) are welcome at Bahr Family Properties. All our homes accept vouchers, and voucher holders apply the same way as everyone else — same application, same screening.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="pets-h">
    <h2 id="pets-h">Pets</h2>
    <p>Pets are allowed: a $250 pet deposit plus $25/month pet rent. Assistance animals are not pets — there are no pet charges for them.</p>
  </section>
</div>
